---
import HomeSharingCredit from './HomeSharingCredit.astro';
import HomeArt from './HomeArt.astro';
import PlanningPaths from './PlanningPaths.astro';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import FeaturedStories from './FeaturedStories.astro';
import {discoveryEntries} from '../data/discovery';
import {featuredStories as picks} from '../data/featured-stories';
---
<Shell><div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A living encyclopedia of Odisha · the first collection</p><h1>Discover Odisha.<br/><em>Imagine the possibilities.</em></h1><p class="lead">Explore its people, places, culture and opportunities. Find the knowledge to plan your visit or investment.</p><div class="actions"><a class="utk-button" href="/destinations/bhubaneswar/">Begin the five stories →</a><a class="text-link" href="/explore/">Find your own beginning →</a></div><p class="hero-note">Bhubaneswar · Dhauli · Konark · Puri · Raghurajpur</p></div><HomeArt/></section><PlanningPaths/><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start with a story</p><h2>A place. A taste.<br/><em class="highlight">A story to carry with you.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/explore/">Explore {discoveryEntries.length} stories &amp; guides →</a></div><FeaturedStories/></section><section class="invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">Make it yours</p><h2>Choose a beginning.<br/>Make it your journey.</h2></div><div><p>Keep the places and meals that draw you in. Add your own notes, choose your days, and carry a personal book. This collection offers a reading thread; arrange travel and timings separately.</p><div class="actions"><a class="utk-button" href="/journey-starters/#stone-sea-makers">Follow stone, sea and makers →</a><a class="text-link" href="/stay-areas/">Compare places to base yourself →</a></div></div></section><section class="invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">Global Connections</p><h2>Rooted here.<br/><em class="highlight">Reaching further.</em></h2></div><div><p>What happens when two cities become part of each other’s story? Begin with Bhubaneswar and Cupertino, learn from other Indian cities, and imagine the next cultural or learning exchange.</p><a class="utk-button" href="/global-connections/">Odisha and the world →</a></div></section><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">A shared beginning</p><h2>Help the story grow.</h2><p class="lead">A remembered name, a careful correction, a photograph with a story. Bring what you know.</p><div class="actions"><a class="utk-button" href="/contribute/">Be part of it →</a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Why Project Odisha? →</a></div></section><details class="utk-disclosure"><summary>Image credits</summary><p>Homepage artwork: imagined scenes inspired by Odisha. These illustrations do not document identified people or locations. Creative direction: Ahimanikya Satapathy.</p><HomeSharingCredit/><ul data-featured-credits>{picks.map(e=><li><a href={e.image.source}>{e.image.caption||e.image.alt}</a> · {e.image.creator} · <a href={e.image.license_url}>{e.image.license}</a>. {e.image.changes}</li>)}</ul></details></div></Shell>
<style>details{font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:30px 0}details li{margin:15px 0}summary{min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}</style>
